WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.8 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Accountability and reporting lines

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Accountability starts with the people you serve and your first supporters, long before a board or funders.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Decide what you report upward, sideways and downward.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Set how often and in what format, from the start.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Pair clear expectations with support, even between co-founders.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You map your accountability lines and first-year reporting rhythm.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
